---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Privacy Policy | Global CGPA"
  description="Read the Privacy Policy for Global CGPA calculator."
  canonical="https://globalcgpa.in/privacy-policy"
>
  <main class="max-w-[780px] mx-auto px-6 py-14">
    <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-500 mb-2">Legal</div>
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-zinc-400 text-sm mb-8">Last updated: January 2025</p>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">1. Zero Personal Data Collection</h2>
      <p>
        Global CGPA is built with a privacy-first approach. We do not require any account registration, email submission, or personal details to use our calculator tools.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">2. Client-Side Processing</h2>
      <p>
        All calculations (CGPA, SGPA, percentage, GPA conversions) are computed locally inside your browser using client-side JavaScript. None of your grades, credits, or inputs are transmitted to our servers or stored externally.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">3. Analytics & Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use basic web analytics (Google Analytics 4) strictly to monitor total page visits and improve performance. No personally identifiable information (PII) is tracked or sold.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6">4. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions regarding this privacy policy, you can contact us at <a href="/contact" class="text-emerald-500 underline">support@globalcgpa.in</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
